# Session scratch — saved chat artefacts, referenced but not part of the project
scratchpad/

# ⛔ CHAT TRANSCRIPTS — NEVER COMMIT. THIS REPO IS PUBLIC.
#
# A chat transcript in a public repo is worse than whatever gap it fills: it
# carries the whole conversation, not the conclusions someone chose to publish.
#
# ⚠️ DELIBERATELY NOT `*.txt`. `docs/claude-ai-project-instructions.txt` is
# TRACKED — it is the pasteable source of the claude.ai Project instructions —
# and a blanket rule would drop it from future commits silently, because
# .gitignore does not warn when it shadows a file someone meant to keep. The
# three `windows/**/CMakeLists.txt` are tracked too.
#
# Patterns are specific for that reason. `*.jsonl` is safe and included because
# Claude Code session transcripts are JSONL and none is tracked (verified, not
# assumed).
MER Refresh Chat*.txt
*Chat content*.txt
*chat-transcript*
transcripts/
*.jsonl
